.TH search 1  "search " 
.SH NAME
search \- Search public snippets on the registry
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsearch\fR [\fB\-\-registry\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIQUERY\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search public snippets on the registry
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-registry\fR \fI<REGISTRY>\fR
Registry base URL (default: `FORGEHUB_REGISTRY` or config)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIQUERY\fR>
Search text
